"19\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Five open books at once</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"560\" width=\"430\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"603\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Swivel Chair</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"638\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">An early rotating seat</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"690\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#ec4899\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ec4899\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Wheel Cipher</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rotating disks reinvented by the military later</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Daily inconveniences turned into invention</text></svg>",
